title: "Code for: Lethal-threshold crossing in a stochastic lesion-repair model"
abstract: >-
  Exact threshold-crossing model of DNA lesion induction and repair
  (birth-death master equation), its Fokker-Planck diffusion limit,
  identifiability experiments and analysis of published survival curves.
